{"id":"ltd2j5eataqfmoe29znfsvh4x","title":"淮河文化视角下皖北方言的价值意蕴","originalTitle":null,"summary":"皖北方言作为淮河文化的活化石，承载着丰富的历史、文化、艺术和社会价值。它见证了区域文化交流的历史，反映了儒家伦理和民俗智慧，是地域艺术的灵魂，也是文化认同的情感纽带。然而，城镇化和代际更迭正压缩其使用场景，学界提出通过媒体创新、文旅融合、家庭传承和数字化保护等措施重构其价值。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=40486&do=blog&id=1560892"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T05:50:43.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.394Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.394Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":16,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"2d3110be-2057-4796-96f2-114e4379277b","title":"皖北方言保护措施提出重构文化价值"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"2d3110be-2057-4796-96f2-114e4379277b","title":"皖北方言保护措施提出重构文化价值"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f7mGBwqm5qAE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}